===Etymology===
From {{etyl|he|en}} {{l|he|מְתוּשֶׁלַח|tr=M'tušelaḥ}}, also spelled {{l|he|מְתוּשָׁלַח|tr=M'tušalaḥ}}. 
===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# The [[oldest]] person whose age is recorded in the [[Hebrew]] [[Bible]], having reportedly lived 969 years.

